 "**A clear work email states its purpose in the subject and first line.** Then list what you need and by when, and end with how to reach you — e.g. subject “Please confirm option B by Friday”.": "**一封清楚的工作郵件，先在標題和第一句說清目的。** 再分點寫需要對方做什麼、什麼時候之前，最後附上聯系方式。例如標題寫“請在周五前確認方案 B”。",
 "**A variable is a name for a piece of data.** The program reads and changes the data through that name: keep the cart total in total and update it whenever an item is added — the name stays, the value changes.": "**變量就是給一份資料起的名字。** 程式通過這個名字讀取和修改資料：比如購物車的總價存進 total，每加一件商品就更新 total，名字不變，裡面的數在變。",
 "**Thawing frozen meat in the fridge is safest.** It stays cold the whole time, which limits bacteria; left at room temperature, the surface warms up and bacteria grow. Move tomorrow’s meat to the fridge the night before.": "**冷凍肉放進冷藏室慢慢解凍最安全。** 溫度一直較低，細菌不容易繁殖；放在室溫下太久，表面容易滋生細菌。可以前一晚把第二天要吃的肉移到冷藏室。",
 "**Use the present simple for habits, repeated actions and facts.** With he, she or it the verb usually adds -s: She drinks coffee every morning.": "**一般現在時用來說習慣、經常發生的事和客觀事實。** 主語是他、她、它時，動詞通常加 -s，例如 She drinks coffee every morning（她每天早上喝咖啡）。",
