 "<ol><li>In Safari on a Mac, open the File menu.</li><li>Choose \"Add to Dock\" and confirm.</li></ol>": "<ol><li>Mac 上的 Safari：點菜單欄\"檔案\"。</li><li>選\"添加到程式坞\"，確認名稱後添加。</li></ol>",
 "<ol><li>Open KnowBack in Chrome or Edge.</li><li>Click the install icon at the right of the address bar, or choose \"Apps → Install KnowBack\" in the top-right menu.</li><li>KnowBack then appears in the Start menu and taskbar.</li></ol>": "<ol><li>用 Chrome 或 Edge 打開知回。</li><li>點地址欄右側的\"安裝\"圖標（電腦加箭頭），或在右上角菜單中選\"應用 → 安裝知回\"。</li><li>安裝後，開始菜單和任務欄裡會出現知回圖標。</li></ol>",
 "<p>Firefox cannot install websites as apps. Open this page in Chrome or Edge to install, or just <a href=\"/\">use it online</a>.</p>": "<p>Firefox 不支援把網站安裝成應用。請用 Chrome 或 Edge 打開這個頁面再安裝，或直接<a href=\"/\">在線使用</a>。</p>",
 "A Bilibili top-100 creator who lab-tests everyday products for safety and false claims.": "B 站百大 UP 主，送檢實測日用品的安全和真假宣傳。",
 "A Bilibili top-100 creator who makes economics, finance and business easy to follow.": "B 站百大 UP 主，把經濟、金融和商業講得通俗易懂。",
 "A bug is a mistake that makes a program behave unexpectedly. Debugging means finding the cause, for example by reading errors and printing values, and fixing it.": "Bug 是讓程式結果不符合預期的錯誤。除錯就是通過閱讀報錯、列印中間結果等方法找到原因並修正。",
 "A closure is a function plus the scope it was created in: an inner function can still use the outer variables after the outer function returns. Handy for counters and private state.": "閉包是函數和它建立時所在作用域的組合：內部函數在外部函數返回後，仍能訪問外部的變量。常用於計數器和私有狀態。",
 "A cloud version exists. Download it first.": "雲端已有版本，請先下載，避免覆蓋其他設備。",
 "A code was sent to {v0}.": "驗證碼已發送到 {v0}。",
 "A condition (if) runs different code depending on whether something is true.": "條件判斷（if）根據條件是否成立，選擇執行不同的代碼。",
 "A function packages code that does one job under a name. You call it with arguments and get a result, instead of repeating the same code.": "函數把完成某件事的一段代碼打包並命名，調用時傳入參數、得到結果，避免重複寫同樣的代碼。",
 "A good goal is specific, measurable, achievable, relevant and time-bound.": "好的目標應當具體、可衡量、可實現、與工作相關、有截止時間。",
 "A Google sign-in window opens asking only to create and access files this app makes; the upload is converted to a Google Doc.": "將打開 Google 授權窗口，只請求“建立和訪問本應用建立的檔案”權限，上傳後轉換為 Google 文檔。",
