 "A leading Bilibili English channel that explains grammar and pronunciation with animation.": "B 站知名英語 UP 主，用動畫把語法和發音講清楚。",
 "A loop repeats the same code a number of times, or until a stop condition is met.": "循環讓同一段代碼按次數或按條件重複執行，直到滿足停止條件。",
 "A rushed project: the situation, your task, what you did, and the outcome.": "講一次趕工專案：當時的情況、你的任務、你做了什麼、最後的結果。",
 "A sleep scientist's guide to sleep for general readers.": "睡眠科學家寫給大众的睡眠指南。",
 "A Stanford neuroscientist on sleep, exercise and health habits.": "斯坦福神經科學家談睡眠、運動和健康習慣。",
 "A suggested duration, not a limit. Keep going or adjust it anytime.": "這是建議時長，完成後可以繼續，也可以隨時調整。",
